flowchart LR
    B[Transition 批次] --> S[下一個 state]
    B --> R[reward]
    B --> D[terminated mask]
    S --> T[Target network]
    T --> M[對 action 取最大值]
    R --> Y[Vanilla DQN target]
    D --> Y
    M --> Y
    O[Online network] --> Q[目前 action 的 Q-value]
    Q --> L[後續 training loss]
    O -. "step % interval = 0 時 hard update" .-> T
